'''Potent sulfur''' is a naturally generated [[block]] in [[sulfur caves]] at the bottom of [[sulfur pools]] and [[sulfur springs]] that produces noxious gas in and on top of [[water]] when placed under it. Noxious gas inflicts the player with 3 seconds of [[Nausea]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Potent sulfur drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
{{Breaking row|Potent Sulfur|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
Potent sulfur generates naturally in the [[sulfur caves]] biome under [[sulfur pool]]s and [[sulfur spring]]s.

